DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmppssccaallee  reads a PBM image as input, and outputs a PBM image enlarged
       N times.  ppbbmmppssccaallee does this enlargement by  pixel  replication,  with
       some additional smoothing of corners and edges.



OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       There  are  no command line options defined specifically for ppbbmmppssccaallee,
       but it recognizes the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
       (See
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ .)


